# LeetCode Solutions

A collection of my solutions to LeetCode problems, documenting my progress in algorithms, data structures, and problem-solving.

The goal of this repository is to strengthen my programming fundamentals, explore different approaches to coding challenges, and prepare for technical interviews.

## Technologies

- C
- Python (planned)

## Solutions

| # | Problem | Language | Difficulty | Time | Space |
|---|---------|----------|------------|------|-------|
| 0001 | [Two Sum](https://leetcode.com/problems/two-sum/) | C | Easy | O(n²) | O(1) |
| 0007 | [Reverse Integer](https://leetcode.com/problems/reverse-integer/) | C | Medium | O(log n) | O(1) |
| 0008 | [String to Integer (atoi)](https://leetcode.com/problems/string-to-integer-atoi/) | C | Medium | O(n) | O(1) |
| 0009 | [Palindrome Number](https://leetcode.com/problems/palindrome-number/) | C | Easy | O(log n) | O(1) |
| 0013 | [Roman to Integer](https://leetcode.com/problems/roman-to-integer/) | C | Easy | O(n) | O(1) |

